 "name_en": "Activity Management in Procurement (19C)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Activity Management in Procurement (19C)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio9f80775de73343d3a52761db178b4cae\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9f80775de73343d3a52761db178b4cae__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This solution process enables the use of Activity Management within procurement processes. Through Activity Management, purchasers can collaborate with internal stakeholders on activities and projects. This collaboration can enhance supplier performance, reduce costs, establish strategic partnerships, or develop new category strategies. Purchasers can create activities related to categories or suppliers and assign appropriate tasks to stakeholders within their organization. By documenting and accessing activities and tasks centrally, purchasers benefit from increased transparency on joint initiatives.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9f80775de73343d3a52761db178b4cae__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create activity</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create task</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send task</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Submit task</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor task</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9f80775de73343d3a52761db178b4cae__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Collaborate with peers on strategic topics, for example, supplier development, performance improvements, strategic partnerships, and audits</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create activities from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> with the option to assign to a purchasing category</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create tasks for an activity and assign to peers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get transparency on supplier-related activities and tasks</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>采购中的活动管理 (19C)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio9f80775de73343d3a52761db178b4cae\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9f80775de73343d3a52761db178b4cae__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">该解决方案流程允许在采购流程中使用活动管理。通过活动管理，采购方可以与内部利益相关方就活动和项目进行协作。这种协作可以提高供应商绩效、降低成本、建立战略合作伙伴关系或开发新的类别策略。采购员可以创建与类别或供应商相关的活动，并将相应的任务分配给组织内的利益相关方。通过集中记录和访问活动和任务，采购员可以从提高联合举措的透明度中获益。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9f80775de73343d3a52761db178b4cae__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建活动</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建任务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发送任务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提交任务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控任务</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio9f80775de73343d3a52761db178b4cae__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在战略主题（例如，供应商开发、绩效改进、战略合作伙伴关系和审计）方面与同事协作</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 创建活动，可以选择分配到采购类别</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为活动创建任务并分配给同级人员</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">了解供应商相关活动和任务</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
